                  for traditional and novel measures: A framework for
                  traditional and novel measures}},
  author       = {Steyerberg, Ewout W and Vickers, Andrew J and Cook, Nancy R
                  and Gerds, Thomas and Gonen, Mithat and Obuchowski, Nancy and
                  Pencina, Michael J and Kattan, Michael W},
  journaltitle = {Epidemiology (Cambridge, Mass.)},
  publisher    = {Ovid Technologies (Wolters Kluwer Health)},
  volume       = {21},
  issue        = {1},
  pages        = {128--138},
